Vendored fumadocs code and examples
In addition to the package patch above, local adaptations include:
- src/components/ui/button.tsx: buttonVariants implementation from
  fumadocs-ui/components/ui/button (upstream source:
  https://github.com/fuma-nama/fumadocs/blob/main/packages/radix-ui/src/components/ui/button.tsx).
- src/components/mdx.tsx: card markup/classes and accordion composition from
  fumadocs-ui/components/card and fumadocs-ui/components/accordion. Local
  changes include non-heading labels, article styling, and accordion headers.
- src/components/ai/search.tsx and src/components/ai/search-context.tsx:
  assistant panel, input/list rendering, and provider/trigger patterns adapted
  from the docs site's AI search example, split into local modules.
- src/components/markdown.tsx: Markdown processing, word wrapping, and rendering
  adapted from the docs site's AI Markdown example, with bounded local caching.
- src/components/search-dialog.tsx: search-input styling adapted from
  fumadocs-ui/components/dialog/search.
- src/components/github-widget.tsx, src/components/page-feedback.tsx, and
  src/components/view-options.tsx: inline brand-icon paths also used by
  fumadocs-ui/components/github-info and layouts/shared/page-actions.
The original assistant examples can be read at:
https://github.com/fuma-nama/fumadocs/blob/f2261572d15eedda2ffbac2b3a63319a0ef56c4e/apps/docs/components/ai/search.tsx
https://github.com/fuma-nama/fumadocs/blob/f2261572d15eedda2ffbac2b3a63319a0ef56c4e/apps/docs/components/ai/markdown.tsx
